{
  "id": "E394",
  "title": "Selecting Courses",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-01-08",
  "synopsis": "Paul and Little Le planned to watch a movie together, but Paul has an important thing unfinished.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50394/16532a7e32fa0d12d6648c85780930b6c6556a77.mp3?1578130562",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "选课\n\n小乐：你怎么还不走啊？\n保罗：马上就要选课了，选完课我才能走。\n小乐：你怎么到现在才告诉我？\n保罗：学校在两个小时前才告诉我要选课了。\n小乐：那怎么办？三十分钟后，电影就要开始了。我们看完电影再选课吧。\n保罗：有一门课我很想听，但是特别火，不快一点就选不到了。\n小乐：好吧，还要等多久？\n保罗：现在开始！啊，我没选到！\n小乐：这么快人就满了？\n保罗：是啊，就是这么快。我们去看电影吧。\n",
    "traditional": "選課\n\n小樂：你怎麼還不走啊？\n保羅：馬上就要選課了，選完課我才能走。\n小樂：你怎麼到現在才告訴我？\n保羅：學校在兩個小時前才告訴我要選課了。\n小樂：那怎麼辦？三十分鐘後，電影就要開始了。我們看完電影再選課吧。\n保羅：有一門課我很想聽，但是特別火，不快一點就選不到了。\n小樂：好吧，還要等多久？\n保羅：現在開始！啊，我沒選到！\n小樂：這麼快人就滿了？\n保羅：是啊，就是這麼快。我們去看電影吧。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Selecting courses"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你怎么还不走啊？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你怎麼還不走啊？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zěn me hái bù zǒu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Why haven’t you left yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：马上就要选课了，选完课我才能走。",
      "traditional": "保羅：馬上就要選課了，選完課我才能走。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó mǎ shàng jiù yào xuǎn kè le xuǎn wán kè wǒ cái néng zǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I have to select courses right now, I can’t leave until I’m finished selecting."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：你怎么到现在才告诉我？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你怎麼到現在才告訴我？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zěn me dào xiàn zài cái gào su wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Why haven’t you told me about this until just now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：学校在两个小时前才告诉我要选课了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：學校在兩個小時前才告訴我要選課了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xué xiào zài liǎng ge xiǎo shí qián cái gào su wǒ yào xuǎn kè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: The school told me just two hours ago that I had to select courses."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：那怎么办？三十分钟后，电影就要开始了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：那怎麼辦？三十分鐘後，電影就要開始了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nà zěn me bàn sān shí fēn zhōng hòu diàn yǐng jiù yào kāi shǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我们看完电影再选课吧。",
      "traditional": "我們看完電影再選課吧。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men kàn wán diàn yǐng zài xuǎn kè ba",
      "english": "Little Le: Then what should we do? 30 minutes from now, the movie will begin."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let’s finish watching the movie and then select the courses."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "保罗：有一门课我很想听，但是特别火，不快一点就选不到了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：有一門課我很想聽，但是特別火，不快一點就選不到了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó yǒu yì mén kè wǒ hěn xiǎng tīng dàn shì tè bié huǒ bú kuài yì diǎn jiù xuǎn bú dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: There’s one course that I really want to study, but it’s especially popular. I can’t select it unless I’m quick."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "小乐：好吧，还要等多久？",
      "traditional": "小樂：好吧，還要等多久？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo ba hái yào děng duō jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: OK, how much longer will it take?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "保罗：现在开始！啊，我没选到！",
      "traditional": "保羅：現在開始！啊，我沒選到！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiàn zài kāi shǐ a wǒ méi xuǎn dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It’s starting now! Ah, I couldn’t select it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "小乐：这么快人就满了？",
      "traditional": "小樂：這麼快人就滿了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhè me kuài rén jiù mǎn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It filled up with people this fast?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "保罗：是啊，就是这么快。我们去看电影吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：是啊，就是這麼快。我們去看電影吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì a jiù shì zhè me kuài wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yes, it goes this fast. Let’s go watch the movie."
    }
  ],
